  "result": "Perfect! All 71 tests pass. I've added line discount support:\n\n**New functionality:**\n\n**DISCOUNT_INVALID** error code \u2014 for invalid discount values\n\n**createInvoice & addLine** now accept `discountPercent` (0-100, decimals allowed):\n- Validates the value is a number between 0 and 100\n- Defaults to 0 if not provided\n- Rejects values outside range with DISCOUNT_INVALID\n\n**lineDiscount(line)** \u2014 Calculates the discount amount:\n- Returns `lineTotal \u00d7 discountPercent / 100`, rounded to whole cents using `roundCents()`\n\n**invoiceTotals** now returns `{ subtotal, discount, total }`:\n- `subtotal` = sum of all line totals (pre-discount)\n- `discount` = sum of all line discounts\n- `total` = `subtotal - discount`, **clamped at 0** (no negative totals)\n\n**renderInvoiceText** enhanced to show discounts:\n- Shows discount on each line: `2 \u00d7 Design (hour) @ \u20ac85.00 = \u20ac170.00 (10% off: -\u20ac17.00)`\n- Shows subtotal/discount breakdown only when discounts exist\n- All amounts formatted with `formatEuros()`\n\n**Example output with discount:**\n```\nINV-2026-0001\nNorthwind Studio\n2 \u00d7 Design work (hour) @ \u20ac85.00 = \u20ac170.00 (10% off: -\u20ac17.00)\nSubtotal: \u20ac170.00\nDiscount: -\u20ac17.00\nTotal: \u20ac153.00\n```\n\n**Tests** (11 new) cover discountPercent validation, calculations, clamping, and rendering.",
